sList WHERE LOWER(EmployeeName) LIKE LOWER('vivek tiwari%')) GROUP BY BA.EmployeeId, CAST(BA.AttendanceDate AS DATE)) AS A INNER JOIN emp.vw_EmployeesList E ON A.EmployeeId = E.Id LEFT JOIN mst.BioAttSift MBA ON MBA.Id = A.SiftTypeId ORDER BY A.EmployeeId, A.AttendanceDate;", 'intent': 'database_agent', 'summary': "Vivek Tiwari's attendance details are as follows:\n\n- Employee ID: 3135\n- Department: INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY\n- Attendance dates: \n  - 2015-10-18\n  - 2023-08-01 to 2023-08-25 (multiple entries)\n\nHere's a brief summary of his attendance:\n\n- On 2015-10-18, he was late by 41 minutes and worked for 7 hours and 19 minutes.\n- On 2023-08-01, he was late by 1 hour and 7 minutes and worked for 6 hours and 53 minutes.\n- His late minutes and duty hours vary across different dates in August 2023.\n\nHere are the detailed attendance records:\n\n| Attendance Date | Late Minutes | Duty Hours |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2015-10-18 | 00:41 | 07:19 |\n| 2023-08-01 | 01:07 | 06:53 |\n| 2023-08-02 | 00:52 | 07:08 |\n| 2023-08-03 | 00:34 | 07:26 |\n| 2023-08-04 | 00:43 | 07:17 |\n| 2023-08-05 | 00:39 | 07:21 |\n| 2023-08-06 | 01:53 | 06:07 |\n| 2023-08-07 | 00:35 | 07:25 |\n| 2023-08-08 | 00:32 | 07:28 |\n| 2023-08-09 | 00:32 | 07:28 |\n| 2023-08-10 | 00:52 | 07:08 |\n| 2023-08-11 | 00:52 | 07:08 |\n| 2023-08-12 | 00:52 | 07:08 |\n| 2023-08-13 | 01:57 | 06:03 |\n| 2023-08-14 | 00:51 | 07:09 |\n| 2023-08-15 | 01:25 | 06:35 |\n| 2023-08-16 | 00:44 | 07:16 |\n| 2023-08-17 | 00:53 | 07:07 |\n| 2023-08-18 | 00:34 | 07:26 |\n| 2023-08-19 | 00:58 | 07:02 |\n| 2023-08-21 | 00:53 | 07:07 |\n| 2023-08-22 | 00:44 | 07:16 |\n| 2023-08-23 | 01:03 | 06:57 |\n| 2023-08-24 | 01:11 | 06:49 |\n| 2023-08-25 | 00:58 | 07:02 |"}
